# What the YoRHa-Shell shell needs from the system (spec 014, FR-002, research R3).
# <package> <required|optional> <what it is for>. Hyprland itself is a prerequisite, not listed.
quickshell                required  the shell runs on it
qt6-declarative           required  QML
qt6-svg                   required  icons
qt6-5compat               required  graphical effects
qt6-shadertools           required  the menus' shaders
qt6-wayland               required  Wayland windows
qt6-multimedia            required  interface sounds
qt6-multimedia-gstreamer  required  the shell's sound backend (spec 013)
qt6-multimedia-ffmpeg     required  the login screen's sound backend (spec 013)
libnotify                 required  notify-send, used by the shell's own notices
file                      required  wallpaper type checks
uwsm                      required  logout from the power menu
curl                      required  yorha update
wireplumber               required  the volume keys (wpctl)
pipewire-pulse            required  audio for programs that speak PulseAudio (the shell's sounds use Qt's own PipeWire backend)
brightnessctl             optional  the brightness keys
kitty                     optional  the terminal of "Update now" (any terminal in shell.json works)
